;; FOUND by the ESH-0101 guard coverage gate. Ledger: SW-86.
;; VM ONLY (vm-src and vm-eskb); both native axes are correct.
;;
;; Internal `define`s in a guard BODY (the protected expression, not a clause)
;; do not produce the body's value correctly on the VM.
;;
;; want: 42
(display (guard (e (#t -1)) (define x 10) (define y 32) (+ x y)))
(newline)
